OL,3,ALabour beats Greens to win Holborn and
OL,4,ASt Pancras as Polanski faces call to
OL,5,Aresign
OL,6,
OL,7,FLabour wins the Holborn and St Pancras
OL,8,Fby-election, with the Greens coming in
OL,9,Fsecond - here's how other parties
OL,10,Fperformed
OL,12,FCamden Council leader Sagal Abdi-Wali -
OL,13,Fwho secured 45% of the vote - uses her
OL,14,Fvictory speech to say she wants to
OL,15,Ftackle homelessness and opportunities
OL,16,Ffor young people
OL,18,FPM Andy Burnham says he's "looking
OL,19,Fforward to working" with the new MP
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/42
