OL,3,APolanski vows to stay on as Green
OL,4,Aleader as criticism mounts
OL,5,
OL,6,FZack Polanski has vowed to stay on as
OL,7,FGreen Party leader after his
OL,8,Fby-election defeat, as he faced calls
OL,9,Ffrom within his own party to resign.
OL,11,FThe leader of the Jewish Greens, Vivien
OL,12,FLichtenstein, said on Friday he "should
OL,13,Fresign", adding it was a "big mistake"
OL,14,Ffor him to have dodged a debate about a
OL,15,Fparty conference motion that declared
OL,16,FZionism a form of racism.
OL,18,FLichtenstein's comments come after
OL,19,Fformer Green Party leader Caroline
OL,20,FLucas accused Polanski of failing to
OL,21,Fshow leadership over the Zionism row.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/42
