OL,3,AADHD and autism at risk of
OL,4,Aover-diagnosis, says report, as author
OL,5,Awarns of rise in mental ill health
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn official review in England finds
OL,8,Fthere is a risk of people being
OL,9,Fover-diagnosed with ADHD and autism -
OL,10,Fthree key findings from the report
OL,12,FAs well as neurodevelopmental
OL,13,Fconditions, the review looks at mental
OL,14,Fill health, particularly in younger
OL,15,Fpeople. Our health correspondent
OL,16,Fexplains the difference
OL,18,FSpeaking to Radio 4's Today programme
OL,19,Fearlier, review chair Prof Peter Fonagy
OL,20,Fsaid there had been a "very real" rise
OL,21,Fin "distress and mental ill health
OL,22,Famong young people"
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/42
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
