OL,3,AADHD and autism at risk of
OL,4,Aover-diagnosis, says report, as author
OL,5,Awarns of rise in mental ill health
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe also notes how conditions such as
OL,8,Fanxiety and depression can "worsen the
OL,9,Ftraits of ADHD and autism" - BBC Verify
OL,10,Flooks at the rising number of diagnoses
OL,11,Ffor both disorders
OL,13,FAsked about the findings, Labour chair
OL,14,FBridget Phillipson says families should
OL,15,Fbe supported "earlier" and there needs
OL,16,Fto be "better access to mental health
OL,17,Fservices" in local communities and
OL,18,Fschools
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/42
