OL,3,AFort Hood survivor supports gunman's
OL,4,Aexecution by firing squad but questions
OL,5,Alivestream
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former US Army sergeant who survived
OL,8,Fthe mass shooting on Fort Hood has said
OL,9,Fthat while he supports the execution of
OL,10,Fthe gunman by firing squad, he is
OL,11,Fconcerned about it being livestreamed.
OL,13,FAlonzo Lunsford, who was shot seven
OL,14,Ftimes, told the BBC that the "method is
OL,15,Fbefitting" for Nidal Hasan because
OL,16,Fother methods like lethal injection
OL,17,Fwould be "doing him a favour".
OL,19,FHasan, a US Army psychiatrist, fatally
OL,20,Fshot 13 unarmed US soldiers in a
OL,21,Fmedical building at Fort Hood, in
OL,22,FTexas, in 2009.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/42
